  "idea": "Sell in the bottom 30% of the 40-candle range (buy in the top 30%; pos = 1 at the trade-direction extreme) after a strong counter UHV (body > 60%, closed at its far end): selling into support after a bullish climax (0319-155047-S; 0320-143152-S misses, its UHV closed at 80% of its range).",
